    "title": "PBKS vs GT highlights: Punjab beat Gujarat by 3 wickets in Mullanpur",
    "text": "Cooper Connolly in action. (Express photo by Kamleshwar Singh)IPL 2026, PBKS vs GT highlights Cooper Connolly’s 44-ball 72 helped Punjab clinch a nail-biter against Gujarat by 3 wickets. Earlier, Vijaykumar Vyshak’s 3/34 from four overs helped Punjab to restrict Gujarat to 162/6. Earlier, Punjab Kings skipper Shreyas Iyer won the toss and opted to bowl first against Shubman Gill’s Gujarat Titans in match 4 of the Indian Premier League at the Maharaja Yadavindra Singh International Cricket Stadium, Mullanpur, New Chandigarh on Tuesday. PBKS vs GT IPL 2026 Live Cricket Streaming Online: Know here Teams: Punjab Kings (Playing XI): Prabhsimran Singh(w), Cooper Connolly, Shreyas Iyer(c), Nehal Wadhera, Shashank Singh, Marcus Stoinis, Marco Jansen, Xavier Bartlett, Vijaykumar Vyshak, Arshdeep Singh, Yuzvendra Chahal Gujarat Titans (Playing XI): Sai Sudharsan, Shubman Gill(c), Jos Buttler(w), Washington Sundar, Glenn Phillips, M Shahrukh Khan, Rahul Tewatia, Rashid Khan, Kagiso Rabada, Ashok Sharma, Mohammed Siraj SCROLL BELOW PBKS VS GT IPL 2026 UPDATES Match EndedIndian Premier League, 2026 - Match 4vsGujarat Titans162/6 (20.0)Match Ended ( Match 4 ) Punjab Kings beat Gujarat Titans by 3 wickets After missing out on the IPL title, Shreyas Iyer is keen to done one better in the 2026, Punjab Kings’ head coach Ricky Ponting said. Iyer, who guided Kolkata Knight Riders in the 2024 season to title, was roped in by PBKS and he didn’t disappoint. Under his captaincy, PBKS topped the points table in the group stage and went on to qualify for the final, where they lost to RCB last season. READ MORE This article was first uploaded on March thirty-first, twenty twenty-six, at fifty minutes past three in the afternoon.",
